132
00:06:42,069 --> 00:06:43,370
I-I do, too.

133
00:06:43,403 --> 00:06:45,372
I have every cd they ever made.

134
00:06:45,405 --> 00:06:46,874
You do?
Yeah!

135
00:06:46,907 --> 00:06:48,642
